    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Although I knew I would have to make some sort of sacrifice to open the chest, I didn't expect it to be like this.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Although I knew I would have to make some sort of sacrifice to open the chest, I didn't expect it to be like this."
