        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 133,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   Well, we helped you find the key you wanted, so it's your turn to help me with my mission.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "Well, we helped you find the key you wanted, so it's your turn to help me with my mission."
    },
    {
        "id": 134,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   As a matter of fact, if you were here earlier, we wouldn't have even needed to hire other people to help the villagers.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "As a matter of fact, if you were here earlier, we wouldn't have even needed to hire other people to help the villagers."
